{
  "slug": "claude-context-monitor",
  "name": "Claude Context Monitor",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Prevent context window exhaustion. Real-time token tracking, semantic compact scoring, and carry-forward memory that fixes cumulative amnesia across `/compact` cycles.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 hooks**.\n\n- **Hooks** (5): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `Stop`, `PreCompact`, `PostCompact`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-context-monitor@claude-community` from `fomyio/claude-context-monitor`.\n\nA Claude Code plugin that watches your context window in real time, predicts when you'll hit the limit, and warns you before it's too late — then makes your `/compact` actually remember what matters.",
